      "id": "HearthomeCityMart_Text_CantBuyRevivesWithTwoBadges",
      "en_US": [
        "The item Revive is something I could\n",
        "use now.\r",
        "But I’ve only got two Gym Badges, so\n",
        "I can’t buy any yet..."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "J’aurais bien besoin d’un Rappel, à\n",
        "l’heure actuelle.\r",
        "Mais ils refusent de m’en vendre parce\n",
        "que je n’ai que deux Badges d’Arène..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "HearthomeCityMart_Text_FindAccessoriesInAmitySquare",
      "en_US": [
        "Do you know Amity Square?\n",
        "It’s a happy and cheerful place.\r",
        "You can find Accessories there you\n",
        "can’t buy in Poké Marts."
      ],
      "fr_FR": [
        "Tu connais le Square Paisible?\n",
        "C’est un endroit très agréable.\r",
        "On y déniche des Accessoires\n",
        "introuvables dans les Boutiques\f",
        "Pokémon."
      ]
    }
  ]
